# Denylist for scripts/validate.py.
#
# Copy this file to .validate-denylist (that name is gitignored, this example is
# not) and replace the placeholders with the private names, handles, hostnames
# or codenames that must never appear in the public repository. One entry per
# line; blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Matching is
# case-insensitive and whole-word, across every tracked or to-be-tracked file.
# This example file itself is exempt from the denylist check only, so the
# placeholders below can stay as they are.
Firstname Lastname
private-hostname.local
internal-codename
